<title>SRI LANKA: Commercial Bank 9-mth profit up 9.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Commercial Bank 9-mth profit up 9.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Commercial Bank of Ceylon Ltd for the nine months to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>		     9 months 1996	 9 months 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover	  2,260.71    vs	1,890.95</p>
<p>    Net profit	  298.89    vs	  272.59</p>
<p>    Tax provision     106.00    vs	  115.00</p>
<p>NOTE - Commercial Bank is one of four private banks listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
